{"sha": "6f9a6b4755789700c468e68579773c73e7ecbd5d104fabbc5d87d3ec0d0ba2e8", "body": ["\\textbf{14.} 取 $a = b = c = d = \\frac12$ 时，对角元", "全为零，$2(bc - ad) = 0$，$2(bd + ac) = 1$，$2(bc +", "ad) = 1$，$2(cd - ab) = 0$，$2(bd - ac) = 0$，$2(cd + ab) =", "1$：", "\\[", "R_q = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 & 1\\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\\\ 0 & 1 & 0", "\\end{pmatrix},", "\\]", "即循环置换 $e_1 \\to e_2 \\to e_3 \\to e_1$。其", "迹为 $0 = 1 + 2\\cos\\theta$，故 $\\theta = \\frac{2\\pi}3$，", "且它固定 $(1,1,1)$：即绕", "主对角线的 $120^\\circ$ 旋转 --- 恰为第 11 题的答案，现", "可见它即循环坐标轴的矩阵。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 在基上验算可得 $\\Phi(\\bar q) =", "\\Phi(q)^*$（$\\bar q$ 的矩阵满足 $\\alpha' =", "\\bar\\alpha$，$\\beta' = -\\beta$，恰是", "$\\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix}\\alpha & \\beta\\\\", "-\\bar\\beta & \\bar\\alpha\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$）的共轭转置。由此", "$\\Phi(q)^*\\Phi(q) = \\Phi(\\bar qq) = N(q)I$，且 $\\det\\Phi(q)", "= \\abs\\alpha^2 + \\abs\\beta^2 = N(q)$：对 $q \\in S^3$，", "$\\Phi(q) \\in SU(2)$，且 $\\Phi$ 为单同态", "（第 1 题）。满射性：设 $U =", "\\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix}\\alpha & \\beta\\\\ \\gamma &", "\\delta\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$，满足 $\\det U = 1$；则", "$U^{-1} = \\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix}\\delta & -\\beta\\\\", "-\\gamma & \\alpha\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$，且 $U^{-1} = U^*", "= \\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix}\\bar\\alpha & \\bar\\gamma\\\\", "\\bar\\beta & \\bar\\delta\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$ 迫使", "$\\delta = \\bar\\alpha$，$\\gamma = -\\bar\\beta$，进而 $1 =", "\\det U = \\abs\\alpha^2 + \\abs\\beta^2$：$U = \\Phi(q)$，对应的", "单位四元数 $q$ 的坐标为 $\\alpha = a + \\iu b$，", "$\\beta = c + \\iu d$。于是 $S^3 \\cong SU(2)$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 实数是中心元，又由 $N(p) = 1$ 得", "$\\overline{pq\\bar p} = p\\bar q\\bar p$，故 $pq\\bar p +", "\\overline{pq\\bar p} = p(q + \\bar q)\\bar p = q + \\bar q$：", "实部是不变量。反之设", "$\\operatorname{Re}q = \\operatorname{Re}q' = a$；", "则纯部的模同为 $\\sqrt{1 - a^2} = s$。若 $s =", "0$，则 $q = q' = \\pm1$。若 $s > 0$，记 $q = a + su$，$q' =", "a + su'$，其中 $u, u'$ 为单位纯四元数；由第 6 题，", "存在把 $u'$ 变为 $u$ 的旋转，即 $p \\in S^3$，使", "$\\rho_p(u') = u$，于是 $pq'\\bar p = a + s\\rho_p(u') =", "q$。因此 $S^3$ 的共轭类为 $\\{1\\}$，$\\{-1\\}$，", "以及对每个 $a \\in \\intoo{-1}1$，$2$ 维球面 $\\{a + su :", "u \\text{ 为单位纯}\\}$，半径为 $s$。在 $\\Phi$ 下，", "$\\operatorname{tr}\\Phi(q) = \\alpha + \\bar\\alpha =", "2\\operatorname{Re}q$：$SU(2)$ 的共轭类恰为迹的", "水平集。就投影而言，若 $q' = pq\\bar p$，则", "$\\rho_{q'} = \\rho_p\\rho_q\\rho_p^{-1}$；反之", "$\\rho_{q'} = \\rho_p\\rho_q\\rho_p^{-1} = \\rho_{pq\\bar p}$", "迫使 $q' = \\pm pq\\bar p$（由核的性质），故", "$\\operatorname{Re}q' = \\pm\\operatorname{Re}q$，即", "$\\cos\\frac{\\theta'}2 = \\abs{\\operatorname{Re}q'} =", "\\abs{\\operatorname{Re}q} = \\cos\\frac\\theta2$，对", "$\\intcc0\\pi$ 中的角，共轭旋转的角相等。", "反之，角相等时，可取代表元，使其具有", "相同的非负实部，由上可知二者共轭：在", "$SO(3)$ 中，旋转的共轭类恰由其", "角决定。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $N$ 是乘性的，故 $\\abs\\cdot$ 是", "$\\mathbb H \\cong \\R^4$ 上的乘性范数，且", "$\\abs{q^k} = \\abs q^k$：级数 $\\sum q^k/k!$ 在", "有限维（从而完备）空间中绝对收敛，", "被 $\\sum\\abs q^k/k! = \\eu^{\\abs q}$ 所控制。对", "单位纯四元数 $u$：$u^2 = -1$，故 $(\\theta u)^{2m} =", "(-1)^m\\theta^{2m}$，且 $(\\theta u)^{2m+1} =", "(-1)^m\\theta^{2m+1}u$；拆分级数，", "\\[", "\\exp(\\theta u) = \\sum_m\\frac{(-1)^m\\theta^{2m}}{(2m)!} +", "u\\sum_m\\frac{(-1)^m\\theta^{2m+1}}{(2m+1)!} = \\cos\\theta +", "\\sin\\theta\\,u .", "\\]", "任一 $q \\in S^3$ 都可写成 $\\cos\\alpha + \\sin\\alpha\\,u$，其中", "$\\alpha \\in \\intcc0\\pi$（第 5 题）：$q = \\exp(\\alpha u)$，", "故 $\\exp(P) = S^3$。最后 $\\exp(su) = \\cos s + \\sin s\\,u", "= q(2s)$，依第 9 题的记号，且 $\\rho_{q(t)} =", "\\eu^{tA_u}$ 在此，即 $\\rho_{\\exp(su)} = \\eu^{2sA_u}$。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 利用乘法表逐分量展开 $vw$：", "乘积 $\\mathrm i\\cdot\\mathrm i = -1$，\\dots\\ 给出", "数量 $-(v_1w_1 + v_2w_2 + v_3w_3)$，而混合", "乘积（$\\mathrm{ij} = \\mathrm k$，$\\mathrm{ji} =", "-\\mathrm k$，\\dots）给出向量 $(v_2w_3 - v_3w_2,\\", "v_3w_1 - v_1w_3,\\ v_1w_2 - v_2w_1)$：$vw = -\\langle v,", "w\\rangle + v\\wedge w$。减去反序乘积：", "$vw - wv = 2\\,v\\wedge w$（数量部分相消，", "向量积相加）。对矩阵，利用 $a\\wedge(b\\wedge", "c) = b\\langle a, c\\rangle - c\\langle a, b\\rangle$：", "\\[", "[A_v, A_w]x = v\\wedge(w\\wedge x) - w\\wedge(v\\wedge x)", "= w\\langle v, x\\rangle - v\\langle w, x\\rangle", "= (v\\wedge w)\\wedge x = A_{v\\wedge w}x .", "\\]", "求导：$\\overline{\\exp(tv)} = \\exp(-tv)$（共轭", "连续，且使纯四元数变号），故", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}\\Bigr|_{t=0}\\exp(tv)\\,x\\,\\exp(-tv) = vx -", "xv = 2\\,v\\wedge x = 2A_vx :", "\\]", "微分为 $v \\mapsto 2A_v$，是一个线性双射，", "从 $P$ 满射到反对称矩阵上，且 $[2A_v, 2A_w]", "= 4A_{v\\wedge w} = 2A_{2v\\wedge w} = 2A_{[v,w]}$ 表明它", "将四元数的换位子映为矩阵的", "换位子。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 作用 $\\rho$ 得：$\\rho(\\varepsilon(t)) =", "\\rho(s(R(t)))\\,\\rho(q(t))^{-1} = R(t)R(t)^{-1} =", "\\operatorname{id}$，故 $\\varepsilon(t) \\in \\ker\\rho =", "\\{\\pm1\\}$（第 4 题）。", "由连续映射 $t \\mapsto s(R(t))$ 与 $t \\mapsto q(t)^{-1} =", "\\bar{q(t)}$ 之积，$\\varepsilon$ 在连通的", "区间 $\\intcc0{2\\pi}$ 上连续，取值于离散的", "二元集 $\\{\\pm1\\}$：它为常值，记作 $\\varepsilon(t) \\equiv", "\\varepsilon$。但 $R(0) = R(2\\pi) = I$，故 $s(R(0)) =", "s(R(2\\pi))$，而 $s(R(0)) = \\varepsilon\\,q(0) =", "\\varepsilon$，且 $s(R(2\\pi)) = \\varepsilon\\,q(2\\pi) =", "-\\varepsilon$：矛盾。不存在连续", "截面：符号的不定性 $\\pm q$ 是整体的，而非", "某一特定公式的缺陷。", ""]}